          <td style="padding:8px;font-family:monospace;" colspan="7">Master 3D Identity Lock: Stylized 3D character, highly detailed facial anatomy, expressive eyes, subsurface scattering skin shader, signature tailored outfit with micro-textures, cinematic studio rim lighting, neutral studio backdrop, octane render aesthetic, 8k resolution, Unreal Engine 5 look. --ar 16:9 --stylize 250 Subject: Nermin. Nermin is a stylized 3d character with well-proportioned facial geometry, large expressive eyes, arched eyebrows, and balanced agile build. Visual details: Stylized 3D animated girl with fair skin, light freckles, big brown eyes, and brown hair styled in a high bun with loose wavy tendrils framing her face.. Wearing Oversized light-blue denim jacket, black and white striped t-shirt, dark cropped wide-leg trousers, multi-colored retro sneakers, and a black crossbody bag.. Consistent character sheet proportions, studio lighting, 8k render.</td>
